# Web feedback landing zone.
#
# netlify/functions/submit-feedback.js commits one JSON file here per submission
# (schema: { submitted_at, source, items: [{component, verdict, comment, severity}] }).
# .github/workflows/web-feedback-intake.yml then folds these into ops/FEEDBACK.yaml via
# scripts/feedback_intake_web.py and deletes the processed files. This dir is normally empty.
